[I] Perl extension for a generic archive extracting mechanism

[T] Archive::Extract is a Perl module providing a generic archive extraction
[T] mechanism. It extracts .tar, .tgz, .gz, .bz2, .xz and .zip files using
[T] either Perl modules or command line tools, whichever is available.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Archive-Extract

